'''Ancient Egg: N206''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that can obtained from the [[Summer Break Cats Castaway (Event Gacha)|Summer Break Cats Castaway]] [[Cat Capsule#Collaboration Event Capsule|Event Cat Capsule]] using Legend Traps. It was added in [[Version 13.6 Update|Version 13.6]].

